  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save lives 3025 children U5yr &amp; 1,360 PLW in Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food insecurity and malnutrition are the main drivers behind the number of people in need. 16.2 million people will go hungry this year (Integrated Food Security Phase Classification (IPC) Phase 3 or higher). This includes 5 million people facing emergency conditions (IPC Phase 4) and nearly 50,000 who were already experiencing catastrophe conditions (IPC Phase 5). Over 2.25 million cases of children aged 0 to 59 months, and more than a million pregnant and lactating women are projected to suff.</narrative>
  </description>
